          "layout": {
            "columns": 1,
            "gap": "16px"
          },
          "text_content": "When to Prune Your Trees Best Seasons for Pruning Late winter and early spring are generally the best times to prune most deciduous trees. Pruning during dormancy reduces stress on the tree and minimizes sap loss. Tools You'll Need Sharp bypass pruners, loppers for thicker branches, and a pruning saw for larger cuts. Always sterilize your tools between cuts to prevent disease spread."
        }
